eight:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.63em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.13em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.13em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">组技能含完全相同的标签</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">组技能含</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">的下级标签（如组有</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">pt</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">，会话是</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">pt</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">）</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">组技能含</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">的上级标签（组有</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">pt</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">，会话是</span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">pt</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">）</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">无共同祖先</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.63em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>典型取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha = 0.6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.6</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.85</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta = 0.85</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.85</span></span></span></span></span>。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta &gt; \\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 的直觉是：一个只声明了 <code>pt</code> 的坐席能应付任意葡语变体（通吃，但可能有细微不地道）；一个声明了 <code>pt-BR</code> 的坐席被派给 <code>pt-PT</code> 会话，可能在某些用词上出错。因此「上级标签覆盖下级需求」比「下级标签覆盖平级需求」更可信。</p>\n<p>主题约束同样要有权重，因为主题分类的置信度波动更大。综合分数是加权组合：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>g</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>l</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>g</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>g</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S(g) = w_1 \\cdot s_{lang}(g,l) + w_2 \\cdot s_{topic}(g,t) + w_3 \\cdot s_{market}(g,m)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\