<span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>——<strong>语言不通的坐席无法服务</strong>，而主题不专精的坐席至少能用流程解决问题。一个常见取值是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_1 = 0.6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.6</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_2 = 0.3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.3</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0.1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_3 = 0.1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.1</span></span></span></span></span>。这些权重不该硬编码在代码里，应该是配置，因为不同市场的最优取值不同。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE agent_skill (&#10;  agent_id    BIGINT      NOT NULL,&#10;  skill_type  VARCHAR(16) NOT NULL,   -- lang | topic | market&#10;  skill_value VARCHAR(32) NOT NULL,&#10;  proficiency TINYINT     NOT NULL,   -- 1-5&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (agent_id, skill_type, skill_value)&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE skill_group (&#10;  group_id      VARCHAR(32) PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  required_lang VARCHAR(32) NOT NULL,&#10;  required_topic VARCHAR(32) NULL,     -- 空表示通吃主题&#10;  market        VARCHAR(8)  NULL,&#10;  priority      INT         NOT NULL,&#10;  fallback_group VARCHAR(32) NULL&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> agent_skill</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  agent_id    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  skill_type  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- lang | topic | market</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  skill_value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  proficiency </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TINYINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">     NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 1-5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (agent_id, skill_type, skill_value)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> skill_group</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  group_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  required_lang </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  required_topic </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,     </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 空表示通吃主题</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  market        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  priority      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  fallback_group </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>fallback_group</code> 这一列是防「零匹配」的关键：每个技能组都要有明确的溢出目标，形成一个有向图。整个图的根节点应该是一个「通用多语言组」，保证任何会话都有归宿。没有 fallback 链的路由引擎一定会遇到「无可用技能组」的会话，而这类会话如果在代码里抛异常，结果就是买家消息石沉大海。</p>\n<h2 id=\"组内分配-从最少占用到加权轮询\">组内分配：从最少占用到加权轮询</h2><p>会话落入技能组之后，分配策略决定它落到哪个坐席身上。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>规则</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>轮询（round-robin）</td>\n<td>按顺序轮流</td>\n<td>会话同质、技能差异小</td>\n<td>忽略当前负载</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最少占用（least busy）</td>\n<td>派给并发会话数最少的坐席</td>\n<td>会话异质、处理时长差异大</td>\n<td>需要实时并发数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>加权轮询</td>\n<td>按坐席产能权重分配</td>\n<td>坐席有兼职/新手/资深差异</td>\n<td>权重需维护</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>技能优先（skill-first）</td>\n<td>派给技能分数最高的</td>\n<td>专门问题、专家稀缺</td>\n<td>专家过载</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>固定分配（sticky）</td>\n<td>派给上次服务该买家的坐席</td>\n<td>复杂历史、需要连续性</td>\n<td>该坐席不在线时需回退</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最少占用是跨境电商场景下最常用的默认策略，因为它对「一条会话可能聊 2 分钟也可能聊 40 分钟」这种长尾分布最稳健。轮询在长尾下会严重不均——一个坐席手上三个复杂案子，另一个手上三个快问快答，两人看起来都是「三个会话」。</p>\n<p>固定分配（sticky）值得特别的开关条件。当同一买家在 30 天内已有已解决会话时，优先派给原坐席能显著减少重复解释。但这条策略必须带<strong>在线检查</strong>：原坐席不在班或已离开团队时，必须静默回退到常规策略，不能让会话堵在那里等人。</p>\n<h2 id=\"路由错误的检测与自愈\">路由错误的检测与自愈</h2><p>路由不是一次性决策，它需要闭环。三类可检测的错误与对应处理。</p>\n<p><strong>错误一：语言误判。</strong> 检测信号是坐席手动改路由（<code>assignee_changed</code> 且 <code>reason_code = wrong_language</code>）。每一次这样的修改都是一条标注样本，应该回流到识别器的评估集。如果某个语言对的误判率持续高于阈值，说明该语言对的先验或阈值需要单独校准。</p>\n<p><strong>错误二：循环转派。</strong> 会话在短时间内被转手超过 N 次（比如 30 分钟内 4 次），这通常意味着技能组配置有缺口——没有组能同时满足语言与主题约束，于是每次匹配都只满足一半。检测到循环时应该直接升级到 tier 2 并附上「路由未命中」的标记，让人工修复配置，而不是继续循环。</p>\n<p><strong>错误三：零匹配。</strong> 进入 <code>fallback_group</code> 的比例是一个健康度指标。它的正常水平应该很低（&lt; 2%），一旦升高，说明新增的语言或主题还没有对应的技能组配置。这个指标应当进入 <a href=\"../sla-quality/service-observability\">客服量/响应/解决监控与大促扩容</a> 的监控面板。</p>\n<p>自愈的核心是把路由决策的<strong>依据</strong>持久化。<code>assignee_changed</code> 事件里应该记录命中的技能组、语言标签与置信度、主题标签与置信度、以及最终分数。没有这些字段，事后无法回答「为什么这条葡语物流问题派给了葡语售前组」——而这个问题在每次配置调优时都会被问到。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>语言是<strong>分层的 BCP 47 标签</strong>，匹配必须做前缀容忍与权重衰减，不能等值比较；技能是原子能力，技能组是路由目标，三者要分开建模。</li>\n<li>短文本是识别失败的主因，应对靠三层：脚本与判别字规则早退、低置信度触发兜底而非硬猜、账务与站点先验做贝叶斯融合。</li>\n<li>路由是多约束满足：语言权重应显著高于主题与市场权重；每个技能组必须有 <code>fallback_group</code>，全图收敛到通用多语言组以杜绝零匹配。</li>\n<li>组内分配默认用最少占用，长尾处理时长下它比轮询稳健；固定分配（sticky）要带在线检查与静默回退。</li>\n<li>路由要闭环：坐席改路由即标注样本、循环转派即配置缺口信号、零匹配率即健康度指标。</li>\n<li>路由决策的完整依据必须写进 <code>assignee_changed</code> 事件，供审计与调优；该事件的形态由 <a href=\"../ticket-conversation/ticket-status-sla\">工单状态机与升级路径</a> 定义。译文一侧的语言能力约束见 <a href=\"mt-assist-agent\">机器翻译辅助坐席</a>，班次覆盖见 <a href=\"timezone-shift\">跨时区班次与 follow-the-sun</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"语言识别与客服技能组路由","id":"语言识别与客服技能组路由"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：语言是标签，技能组是标签集合","id":"核心概念-语言是标签-技能组是标签集合"},{"level":2,"text":"短文本为什么是语言识别的主要失败源","id":"短文本为什么是语言识别的主要失败源"},{"level":2,"text":"语言与技能的双维度匹配","id":"语言与技能的双维度匹配"},{"level":2,"text":"组内分配：从最少占用到加权轮询","id":"组内分配-从最少占用到加权轮询"},{"level":2,"text":"路由错误的检测与自愈","id":"路由错误的检测与自愈"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"工单状态机与升级路径","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/cross-border-customer-service/ticket-conversation/ticket-status-sla"},"next":{"title":"机器翻译辅助坐席（非自动回复）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/cross-border-customer-service/multilingual-routing/mt-assist-agent"}}